    .string "Oh, that machine the BOSS stole.\p"
    .string "It's here somewhere.\p"
    .string "That RALTS was stolen from a\n"
    .string "girl on ROUTE 8.$"

RocketHideout_B3F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
